1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:02,520
- [Narrator] At Meta, we use
information to provide you

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:05,500
with a more personal, secure,
and meaningful experience.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,960
But where does that information come from?

4
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:11,090
The information we collect
comes from a variety of sources.

5
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,020
One is your activity

6
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:14,360
on Meta product app services and hardware.

7
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:16,680
Things like liking an Instagram post,

8
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:18,780
playing a game on your Meta Quest 2,

9
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:21,740
buying something through
Marketplace or sharing fundraisers

10
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:24,490
on Facebook all generate information.

11
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:26,980
And sometimes businesses
also share information

12
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,280
with us like your activity
on their websites.

13
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:32,070
They may also share
experiences you have offline,

14
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:34,930
like signing up for rewards
card with your email address.

15
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:37,560
This makes it easier for
them to share promotions,

16
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,840
product information,
and other ads with you

17
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,390
through our apps consistent
with the choices you make.

18
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,210
We know that people want to understand

19
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:46,350
and control what we do
with this information.

20
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:49,560
That's why we offer a number
of ways to help you personalize

21
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,590
and manage things the way you want.

22
00:00:51,590 --> 00:00:53,860
For example, maybe you've
been shopping around

23
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:56,490
for a new mattress and
finally found the one.

24
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:59,430
Now that your hunt is over,
maybe you don't want to see ads

25
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:01,350
from certain mattress brands anymore.

26
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:03,880
If so, you can go to Ad Preferences

27
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:06,600
and hide ads from those
specific advertisers

28
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,750
or manage your ad settings more generally.

29
00:01:08,750 --> 00:01:10,630
Or remember that rewards card?

30
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:12,980
By signing up, you may start seeing deals

31
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:14,560
for their products popping up.

32
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:16,510
Using Off-Facebook Activity,

33
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:19,470
you can view a summary of the
information Facebook receives

34
00:01:19,470 --> 00:01:22,030
about your activity on
other apps and websites

35
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:24,620
and choose to disconnect
it from your account.

36
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:28,000
When it comes to your
information, we're here for you.

37
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,420
And helping you understand
how your information

38
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:33,430
is collected, used, and
shared is our responsibility.

39
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:36,320
So whether you're messaging,
posting, shopping, liking,

40
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,670
or sharing, we're committed
to helping you have

41
00:01:38,670 --> 00:01:40,300
the best experience possible

42
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,493
across all of our apps and products.